{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/Ikarus_parkour_text_small.png?t=1752855524\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An immersive precision 3D platformer set within a deadly game show, hosted by the Elites for their twisted entertainment. Contestants, who voluntarily sign up, are transported to an 850-meter vertical tower, buried deep underground in an unknown location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.poster.avif?t=1752855524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.webm?t=1752855524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.mp4?t=1752855524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/Ikarus_parkour_text_gamemodes.png?t=1752855524\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hard Mode</strong> -\u00a0no checkpoints and a speedrun timer</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Casual Mode </strong>-\u00a0frequent checkpoints and no timer.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/Gamemodes.png?t=1752855524\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/Ikarus_parkour_text_your_goal.png?t=1752855524\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach the top to win a life-changing sum of money and your freedom. However, the stakes are as high as the tower itself\u2014fall, and it\u2019s the end. Every leap and maneuver is a matter of life and death. Can you survive the tower of Ikarus and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.poster.avif?t=1752855524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.webm?t=1752855524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.mp4?t=1752855524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/Ikarus_parkour_TOI.png?t=1752855524\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the tower's deadly beauty,\u00a0an immense structure, split into four distinct levels, each with its own unique aesthetic, new obstacles and increased difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3167280?t=1752855524","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752855524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/bf827f1d42dfc1c76f61d9e9bb5c3c5935bbbdfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752855524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akam